golang.org/x/term is a Go library (no binaries of its own) supplying
terminal helpers that don't live in the standard library: putting a
tty into raw mode, reading the terminal size, and a line-editing/
password-reading Terminal type, across Unix, Windows, and Plan 9.

License: BSD-3-Clause (see /usr/doc/go-term-<version>/LICENSE and
PATENTS).
